Build a discrete block-activity cache key for a year; use only within one evaluation to avoid reusing AD tape vertices.
@param data Validated original-input schema for the supported swordfish assessment.
@param year Calendar year used to select observations, deviations or active control blocks.
@return The typed result described above, with the module units and indexing conventions.

Resolve a fleet selectivity parameter with year-specific replacement blocks and canonical parameter mapping.
@tparam T Ordinary or AD scalar; all returned AD values belong to the active evaluation tape.
@param data Validated original-input schema for the supported swordfish assessment.
@param p Native canonical-name parameter map; all required fixed and estimated values must be present.
@param fleet One-based source fleet identifier, not a zero-based vector offset.
@param index One-based selectivity-parameter index in the canonical fleet parameter name.
@param year Calendar year used to select observations, deviations or active control blocks.
@return The typed result described above, with the module units and indexing conventions.

Build fleet length-selectivity curves for supported constant, logistic, double-normal and mirror patterns, including active blocks.
@tparam T Ordinary or AD scalar; all returned AD values belong to the active evaluation tape.
@param data Validated original-input schema for the supported swordfish assessment.
@param p Native canonical-name parameter map; all required fixed and estimated values must be present.
@param year Calendar year used to select observations, deviations or active control blocks.
@return The typed result described above, with the module units and indexing conventions.

Integrate fleet length selectivity and weight over an age-length key to obtain selected-at-age summary quantities.
@tparam T Ordinary or AD scalar; all returned AD values belong to the active evaluation tape.
@param data Validated original-input schema for the supported swordfish assessment.
@param p Native canonical-name parameter map; all required fixed and estimated values must be present.
@param curve One fleet length-selectivity vector on the population integration grid.
